        "updated": {
          "[72]": {
            "content": "'''Luke Skywalker''' was a [[Jedi]] Master, son of [[Anakin Skywalker]], and the hero who redeemed his father and ended the [[Galactic Empire]].\n\n== Biography ==\n\nLuke Skywalker was born in 19 BBY on [[Polis Massa]] and raised by his uncle and aunt on [[Tatooine]]. He destroyed the first [[Death Star]] at the [[Battle of Yavin]] in 0 BBY, trained briefly under [[Yoda]] on [[Dagobah]], and turned [[Darth Vader]] back to the light in 4 ABY. He later trained [[Rey]] and projected himself across the galaxy to face [[Kylo Ren]] on [[Crait]] in 34 ABY.\n\n== Abilities ==\n\n* Master of the [[Force]] \u2014 telekinesis, mind influence, projection\n* Master lightsaber duelist (Form V \u2014 Djem So)\n* Skilled pilot of T-65B X-wing starfighter\n* Mechanically gifted; built his own green-bladed lightsaber\n\n== Relationships ==\n\n* [[Anakin Skywalker]] &mdash; father\n* [[Padm\u00e9 Amidala]] &mdash; mother\n* [[Leia Organa]] &mdash; twin sister\n* [[Han Solo]] &mdash; brother-in-law\n* [[Rey]] &mdash; padawan\n* [[Yoda]] &mdash; master\n\n== Appearances ==\n\n* ''[[A New Hope]]''\n* ''[[The Empire Strikes Back]]''\n* ''[[Return of the Jedi]]''\n* ''[[The Force Awakens]]''\n* ''[[The Last Jedi]]''\n* ''[[The Rise of Skywalker]]''\n* ''[[The Mandalorian]]''\n* ''[[The Book of Boba Fett]]''\n\n== Notable quote ==\n\n''\"No. I am a Jedi, like my father before me.\"''\n\n\n== Apocrypha ==\nUnverified rumors persist about Luke's role in the High Republic era.",
